	GMOS INSTRUMENT SEQUENCER SOURCE CODE DIRECTORY
	================================================

This directory contains the C code and header files for the GMOS Instrument
Sequencer software. The following files are contained:

Header files
------------
gmSeq.h               - All definitions for instrument sequencer

C code
------
dbMatchField.c        - Utility to search for all record fields
                        with a particular value (engineering only).
gmSeqCadLib.c         - All the functions implementing the high level
                        CAD commands.
gmSeqDisplayMenus.c   - Functions for generating arrays of strings
                        used to populate the filter, grating and mask
                        name menus. (Only present to make the "dm"
                        screens easier to use).
gmSeqLib.c            - All the general purpose functions.
gmSeqTracking.c       - All the functions relating to AtmDC tracking
                        and flexure control.
